{"id":"bb416e45accee42f","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-zfc-geology-mantle.md","title":"ZFC Geology Mantle","display":"df-zfc-geology-mantle — ZFC Geology Mantle","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-geology-mantle","aliases":["58-df-zfc-geology-mantle"],"display":"df-zfc-geology-mantle — ZFC Geology Mantle","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-geology-ground-model.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-geology-mantle"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-geology-mantle</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-geology-mantle — ZFC Geology Mantle"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7af5bfd89393a98a\" href=\"?note=7af5bfd89393a98a\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-geology-ground-model.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-geology-ground-model.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb M,M\\in V\">\\(\\mathbb M,M\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGeologyMantle}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGeologyMantle}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGeologyGroundModel}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGeologyGroundModel}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (ground-model predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7af5bfd89393a98a\" href=\"?note=7af5bfd89393a98a\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-geology-ground-model.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-geology-ground-model.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}geology\\text{-}mantle} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGeologyMantle}_S(\\mathbb M,M) \\leftrightarrow \\mathbb M\\subseteq M\\land\\forall x\\in M\\;\\Bigl(x\\in\\mathbb M\\leftrightarrow\\forall W,\\mathbb P,G\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcGeologyGroundModel}_S(M,W,\\mathbb P,G)\\to x\\in W)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}geology\\text{-}mantle} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGeologyMantle}_S(\\mathbb M,M) \\leftrightarrow \\mathbb M\\subseteq M\\land\\forall x\\in M\\;\\Bigl(x\\in\\mathbb M\\leftrightarrow\\forall W,\\mathbb P,G\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcGeologyGroundModel}_S(M,W,\\mathbb P,G)\\to x\\in W)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The ambient model <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> is explicit, matching the four arguments of the ground-model predicate and avoiding an ill-typed intersection of an unspecified class of grounds.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-geology-ground-model.md","status":"resolved","id":"7af5bfd89393a98a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-geology-ground-model.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-geology-ground-model.md","status":"resolved","id":"7af5bfd89393a98a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcG